1:0-38 "// French for the farm's studio texts." comment.line.double-slash.canon
2:0-2 "//" comment.line.double-slash.canon
3:0-78 "// Keys are paths into farm.canon and farm.view.canon, never the English text:" comment.line.double-slash.canon
4:0-84 "// rewording the English does not orphan the translation, and renaming a field makes" comment.line.double-slash.canon
5:0-49 "// its key an error here instead of a silent gap." comment.line.double-slash.canon
6:0-2 "//" comment.line.double-slash.canon
7:0-81 "//   canon i18n stub fr     adds every missing key, with the English as a comment" comment.line.double-slash.canon
8:0-90 "//   canon check            a missing key is a warning (the studio falls back to English);" comment.line.double-slash.canon
9:0-67 "//                          a key that no longer exists is an error" comment.line.double-slash.canon
10:0-2 "//" comment.line.double-slash.canon
11:0-87 "// Same model as Resource/Schema/i18n/fr today (English in source, fr overlay, fallback" comment.line.double-slash.canon
12:0-76 "// to English), with paths checked by the compiler instead of JSON pointers." comment.line.double-slash.canon
